                        "entry_id": "fc961ff9-651b-3a70-832c-2fac35fabb5e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A short-stemmed Irish pipe made out of clay."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "349383e9-5b59-468d-a5b4-338138b59c00",
                                "sense_id": "9f39e028-a9b0-3683-87e4-855f8386cb04",
                                "text": "He usually had in his mouth a short dudeen; but in an evil moment he put the dudeen, lighted, in the pocket among the powder."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "01714b12-e8e2-4753-bd50-03c3551b3508",
                                "sense_id": "9f39e028-a9b0-3683-87e4-855f8386cb04",
                                "text": "And I marches him back with me all serene,\nWith, tucked in me gub, me old dudeen."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "b515016a-7e18-436c-9a71-c881f20f7a6a",
                                "sense_id": "9f39e028-a9b0-3683-87e4-855f8386cb04",
                                "text": "From it he pinched a smidgen of snuff and packed the tobacco into his dudeen, a terrible habit for a young man to possess."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
